摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Telegram duty gateway for DeepSeek Harness: phone-message task loop, global approval forwarding, duty/local toggle, zh/en","id":"gh:1334503581","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-telegram-duty","slug":"luzhengyangtx/dsh-telegram-duty","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","telegram","telegram-bot"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Telegram duty gateway for DeepSeek Harness: phone-message task loop, global approval forwarding, dut"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"y/local toggle, zh/en"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-telegram-duty"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"[](https://awesome-dsh-plugin.com) [](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@luzhengyangtx/dsh-telegram-duty"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"](https://awesome-dsh-plugin.com) [](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@luzhengyangtx/dsh-telegram-duty)"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Turn DeepSeek Harness (DSH) into your always-on pocket duty office: message a Telegram bot from your"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" phone, the duty agent gets to work, and the result comes back to your phone. Idle cost is zero toke"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ns — the plugin long-polls `getUpdates` and only wakes an agent when a message arrives."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"中文说明"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"> **DeepSeek Harness ≥ 0.1.2-rc.1 is required.** Since v0.5.0 the plugin reads session history throu"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"gh the `session.snapshotEvents()` API, which does not exist in 0.1.1-rc.2 and older (it was introduc"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"ed in `dsh-v0.1.2-rc.1`). If you are on **0.1.1-rc.2 or older, stay on npm `0.4.0`** — the latest ve"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"rsion will fail to load there."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Quick Start (≈10 minutes)"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"1. **Create a bot** — chat with @BotFather, send `/newbot`, and copy the token (looks like `123456:A"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"BC...`).\n2. **Find your chat id** — send any message to @userinfobot (or to your new bot) and read t"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"he numeric `id`.\n3. **Install the plugin** — from inside a DeepSeek Harness checkout:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"4. **Configure** — add to `C:\\Users\\<you>\\.dsh\\profiles\\web\\cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"5. **Restart** `dsh web` and send any message to your bot from the phone. Done — the duty agent answ"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"*Restart** `dsh web` and send any message to your bot from the phone. Done — the duty agent answers."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"> While on duty, the web UI shows a banner telling you approvals are forwarded to your phone, with a"},{"id":"p14s2","text":" one-click switch back."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- 📱 **Task loop** — Telegram message → dedicated \"duty\" DSH session (its agent has the standard tool"},{"id":"p16s2","text":" set) → final reply back to Telegram; long replies are split under Telegram's message limit.\n- ⏳ **I"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"nstant feedback** — every task message is acknowledged immediately (\"📨 Received, generating…\") and t"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"he phone keeps showing the \"typing…\" animation until the result arrives; errors report a clear \"⚠️ P"},{"id":"p16s5","text":"rocessing error\".\n- 🎯 **Targeted sessions** — `/sessions` lists your workspace sessions (live and of"},{"id":"p16s6","text":"fline, matching the web sidebar; blank drafts are hidden) with numbered buttons: tap one to route fo"},{"id":"p16s7","text":"llowing messages there. Prefix one message with `#N` to send just that one to session N. `/duty` ret"},{"id":"p16s8","text":"urns to the default duty route. Offline sessions are woken automatically on the first targeted messa"},{"id":"p16s9","text":"ge.\n- 🔐 **Whitelist** — only your own chat id is served; other senders are logged and ignored.\n- ✅ *"},{"id":"p16s10","text":"*Global approval forwarding** — in *duty* mode, approval requests from **all** sessions go to your p"},{"id":"p16s11","text":"hone with **[✅ Approve] [⛔ Reject] buttons** (tap to answer; typing `3 approve / 3 reject` still wor"},{"id":"p16s12","text":"ks). Unanswered approvals time out to *rejected* (fail-closed, 10 minutes by default). `/away` warns"},{"id":"p16s13","text":" when the web UI still holds unanswered approvals, and `/unblock` cancels turns stuck on them.\n- ❓ *"},{"id":"p16s14","text":"*telegram_ask tool** — when an agent needs you to choose between options, confirm something, or supp"},{"id":"p16s15","text":"ly missing information, it pushes the question to your phone with **one button per option**; the dut"},{"id":"p16s16","text":"y agent is prompted to prefer it.\n- 📣 **telegram_notify tool** — any session's agent can proactively"},{"id":"p16s17","text":" push a message to your phone (reports, reminders, notifications), no waiting required.\n- 🔀 **Duty /"},{"id":"p16s18","text":" local toggle**\n- Enter duty: send any phone message, send `/away`, or flip `watchMode` in the web s"},{"id":"p16s19","text":"ettings.\n- Back to local: send any message in the web UI, or send `/back`.\n- In local mode approvals"},{"id":"p16s20","text":" stay in the web popup; in duty mode the popup is paused.\n- 🚩 **Duty banner** — while on duty, a fra"},{"id":"p16s21","text":"me-wide web banner shows \"approvals are on your phone\" with a one-click switch back.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"All fields live in the `telegram-duty` settings namespace (the web Settings page shows it, or put th"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"em under the patch row's `config:`)."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| Field | Default | Meaning |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| `token` | — | Bot token (marked secret; never shown in settings UIs). Alternatively set `credentia"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"lsFile` to a JSON file with `token` / `chat_id` / `proxy`. |\n| `chatId` | — | Whitelisted chat id. |"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"\n| `proxy` | (empty) | HTTP proxy used for Bot API calls. **Leave empty for a direct connection — on"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"ly set a local proxy (e.g. `http://127.0.0.1:7890`) when Telegram is blocked in your network, and ke"},{"id":"p20s5","text":"ep that proxy running.** |\n| `sessionId` | `telegram-duty` | Stable DSH session id; created on first"},{"id":"p20s6","text":" message. |\n| `dutyCwd` | process cwd | Workspace directory of the duty session. |\n| `approvalTimeou"},{"id":"p20s7","text":"tMinutes` | `10` | Unanswered approvals are rejected after this. |\n| `watchMode` | `local` | `local`"},{"id":"p20s8","text":" (web popups) or `duty` (approvals to Telegram). |\n| `language` | `en` | Language of all Telegram me"},{"id":"p20s9","text":"ssages: `en` or `zh`. |\n| `dataDir` | `<DSH_HOME>/storages/telegram-duty` | Offset persistence direc"},{"id":"p20s10","text":"tory. |\n| `credentialsFile` | — | Optional JSON file `{ token, chat_id, proxy }` for credentials def"},{"id":"p20s11","text":"aults. |\n| `replyChunkChars` | `3800` | Split threshold for long replies (Telegram limit 4096). |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Phone commands"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- `/help` — usage\n- `/sessions` — list your workspace sessions (live + offline) with numbered button"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"s; tap a number to route following messages there\n- `#N message` — send just this one message to ses"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"sion N (numbering from the latest `/sessions`; expires after 30 minutes)\n- `/duty` — back to the def"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"ault duty-session route\n- `/away` — enter duty mode (approvals go to the phone); warns about approva"},{"id":"p22s5","text":"ls the web UI still holds\n- `/unblock` — cancel turns stuck on unanswered web approvals (resend the "},{"id":"p22s6","text":"task afterwards)\n- `/back` — return to local mode\n- `3 approve` / `3 reject` — answer approval #3; w"},{"id":"p22s7","text":"ith a single pending approval, bare `approve`/`reject` works too."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## FAQ"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- **My bot doesn't reply.** Check in order: ① token and chatId are correct; ② you have sent `/start`"},{"id":"p24s2","text":" to the bot at least once (bots cannot message first); ③ the DSH log shows no `telegram-duty` errors"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"; ④ `watchMode`/language behave as expected.\n- **How do I find my chat id?** Send any message to @us"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"erinfobot; it replies with your numeric id.\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
